{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_evals_m8_orchestration_orchestration_delta", "label": "The M8 Orchestration Delta", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/evals/m8-orchestration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It points both ways depending on the workload, which is the useful result."}, {"id": "docs_evals_m8_orchestration_pipeline", "label": "Pipeline \u2014 Each Item Flows Independently", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/m8-orchestration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The default, not because pipelining is always faster (it demonstrably is not) but because a barrier's cost is invisible: it never fails, it only wastes."}, {"id": "docs_evals_m8_orchestration_barrier", "label": "Barrier \u2014 Every Item Clears A Stage First", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/m8-orchestration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Worth it only when stage N+1 genuinely needs cross-item context. Saved 0% when one item dominates every stage."}, {"id": "docs_evals_m8_orchestration_subagent_preamble_cost", "label": "The Cost Of A Subagent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/m8-orchestration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A fan-out of n children pays the preamble n times. The trade is context isolation, strongly positive when exploration is large and the conclusion small."}, {"id": "docs_evals_m8_orchestration_no_fan_out_task_in_the_suite", "label": "The Suite Has No Fan-Out Task, So Its Delta Is Not Claimed", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evals/m8-orchestration.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "ration